---
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import CyberAsterisk from '../components/agency/CyberAsterisk.astro';
import AgencyLayout from '../layouts/AgencyLayout.astro';
import AgencyInvitation from '../components/agency/AgencyInvitation.astro';
import CyberSectionWordmark from '../components/agency/CyberSectionWordmark.astro';
import ResponsiveStudy from '../components/agency/ResponsiveStudy.astro';
---
<AgencyLayout title="The studio — WebDECOR" active="studio">
<section data-layout-key="hero" class="wd-dossier wd-studio-hero"><div class="ag-rail"><a href="/">WEBDECOR / HOME</a><span>02 / THE PRACTICE</span></div><h1 class="wd-page-mark"><CyberSectionWordmark text="STUDIO" weight={16}/><span class="cy-sr-only">The studio</span></h1><div class="wd-studio-composition"><figure class="wd-observation"><img src="/images/crt-eye.webp" alt="A grainy monochrome study of a human eye" width="1280" height="1280"/><figcaption>01 / OBSERVATION</figcaption><span class="wd-eye-reticle" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="plus"/></span></figure><div class="wd-studio-intro"><span class="cy-label">INDEPENDENT BY DESIGN</span><h2>Human instinct.<br/>Digital expression.</h2><p>WebDECOR is a web design practice for brands that want their website to feel like their own. Strategy, art direction, and development belong in the same conversation.</p><div class="wd-studio-signature"><span>ARTISTIC INSTINCT.<br/>STRUCTURAL THINKING.</span><b aria-hidden="true"><CyberAsterisk/></b></div></div></div></section>
<section data-layout-key="manifesto" class="wd-manifesto"><span class="cy-label">THE POINT OF VIEW</span><h2>Make it feel<br/><em>like someone.</em></h2><div><p>A typeface. A crop. A line of copy. The rhythm between pages. The moment an interaction makes sense.</p><p>Character comes from those decisions working together. We look for a strong idea, then carry it through the entire website.</p></div></section>
<section data-layout-key="principles" class="wd-principles" aria-label="Design principles"><article><span class="cy-label">01 / INTENTION</span><div class="wd-principle-art wd-intention" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b><Icon name="plus"/></b></div><h2>Start with a reason.</h2><p>The brand, the audience, and the purpose of the website shape the direction. Every visual choice has a job to do.</p></article><article><span class="cy-label">02 / EXPRESSION</span><div class="wd-principle-art wd-expression" aria-hidden="true"><span>Aa</span><b>Aa</b></div><h2>Make a clear choice.</h2><p>A distinctive point of view connects the imagery, the interface, and the words. One language, many ways to express it.</p></article><article><span class="cy-label">03 / EXPERIENCE</span><div class="wd-principle-art wd-experience" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><span><Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></span></div><h2>Care for the details.</h2><p>Navigation, responsive layouts, accessible controls, and a considered handover complete the experience.</p></article></section>
<section data-layout-key="proof" class="wd-studio-proof"><div><span class="cy-label">IN PRACTICE / RESPONSIVE DESIGN</span><h2>Same character.<br/>Different canvas.</h2><p>A website has to hold together beyond its first screen. Switch between wide and compact layouts to see the hierarchy adapt while the identity stays intact.</p><a href="/services/#build" class="cy-text-link">EXPLORE THE BUILD <Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a></div><ResponsiveStudy id="studio-proof"/></section>
<section data-layout-key="links" class="ag-studio-links"><span class="cy-label">CONTINUE EXPLORING</span><a href="/services/"><span>What we can make together</span><b aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></b></a><a href="/explore/"><span>See the design studies</span><b aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></b></a></section>
<AgencyInvitation/>
</AgencyLayout>
